8. Query dengan Athena

Masuk:

Amazon Athena

Buat database:

CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS lks2026_db;
Buat Tabel Athena
CREATE EXTERNAL TABLE lks2026_db.transactions (
  transaction_id STRING,
  user_id STRING,
  category STRING,
  amount DOUBLE,
  status STRING
)
PARTITIONED BY (
  year INT,
  month INT
)
STORED AS PARQUET
LOCATION 's3://lks2026-data/processed/transactions/';
Load Partition
MSCK REPAIR TABLE lks2026_db.transactions;

Athena akan mendeteksi:

year=2026
month=1

secara otomatis.

9. Query Analitik
Total transaksi
SELECT COUNT(*)
FROM lks2026_db.transactions;
Total pendapatan
SELECT SUM(amount)
FROM lks2026_db.transactions;
Top kategori
SELECT
  category,
  COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,
  SUM(amount) AS total_amount
FROM lks2026_db.transactions
GROUP BY category
ORDER BY total_amount DESC;

Contoh hasil:

category	total_transactions	total_amount
Shopping	1	500
Food	2	300
Transport	1	50
Rata-rata transaksi
SELECT
  category,
  AVG(amount) AS avg_amount
FROM lks2026_db.transactions
GROUP BY category;
